---
description: Use installed agentic-development policy to identify retained history obligations.
args:
  result: Result
  original: OriginalArtifact
returns: HistoryReview
---
Use the exact result owner's product area and consumers together with empty blockers. Call development.planAgenticChange.reviewImpact.reviewHistory with goal equal to original.text and those exact units. Return the unchanged goal, units and result. Preserve product history concerns in the returned readback.
